WEBVTT Kind: captions; Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
I dreamt last night the moon was
so bright it melted the world

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.001
away and it wasn't alarming when I
saw a prince charming come into my

00:00:16.001 --> 00:00:23.001
bedroom and say let me persuade you to come

00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:27.001
to the place where tomorrow meets today.

00:00:28.001 --> 00:00:33.001
Oh, thank you. It sounds very exciting.
May I come just as I am?

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:42.000
Hey, girls don't go to more trommers
dressed in a pair of pink pajamas.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Maybe they don't, but I don't care.
Haven't got a single thing to wear.

00:00:47.001 --> 00:00:49.000
Quick, please, a gown.

00:00:49.001 --> 00:00:51.001
Ooh, I'll be the talk of the town.

00:00:53.001 --> 00:00:55.001
Oh, my.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Go after it. Why?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.001
I followed my heart through the night past
a thousand windows, yellow with light.

00:01:02.001 --> 00:01:07.000
Down, down it fell and it landed
in the Wodorf Astoria Hotel.

00:01:26.001 --> 00:01:32.000
I'm a girl who happens to think that
a brand new car is better than me.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Excited?

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Denied it. So glad I got invited.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Since it's just a dream and involves no money,
which one would you

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.001
like me to buy you, honey?

00:01:46.001 --> 00:01:53.001
They are all so beautiful,
I really don't know, so let me go down,

00:01:53.001 --> 00:01:58.001
get the load down,
and look at it one more slow-down.

00:02:07.001 --> 00:02:09.000
I want a carpet.

00:02:11.001 --> 00:02:12.001
I thought you would.

00:02:14.001 --> 00:02:19.000
Ooh, I want a party or two.

00:02:20.001 --> 00:02:23.001
Okay, we'll have the usual two-car garage.

00:02:26.001 --> 00:02:30.000
How do you feel about this final mobile?

00:02:30.001 --> 00:02:34.000
It's easy to see myself taking the wheel.

00:02:37.001 --> 00:02:39.001
This view, it's a beaut.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.000
I'll try it.

00:02:43.001 --> 00:02:46.001
Ooh, what a dreamy ride.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.001
I think that we ought to buy it.

00:02:58.001 --> 00:03:01.001
Let's go all out and buy a Cadillac too.

00:03:04.001 --> 00:03:09.000
I can hardly wait for this dream to come true.

00:03:10.001 --> 00:03:12.001
Hey, lady, you're apron is gone.

00:03:12.001 --> 00:03:14.001
Okay, let's get her into the kitchen quick.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:27.000
Just like a

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.000
man, you give him a break,
and you run up in the kitchen,

00:03:32.001 --> 00:03:34.001
baking a cake.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.001
But this was a kitchen like none I've seen.

00:03:37.001 --> 00:03:41.001
You can put a card in the slot and onto
the screen pops a picture of just how

00:03:41.001 --> 00:03:45.001
your dish will look,
plus all the ingredients you need to cook.

00:03:48.001 --> 00:03:53.000
No need for the bride to feel tragic.

00:03:53.001 --> 00:03:55.001
The rest is push-button magic.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:01.000
So whether you bake or broil or stew,
the Frigidaire kitchen does it all for you.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.000
Don't have to be chained to the stove all day.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.000
Just set the timer and you're on your way.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.001
Tick tock, tick tock,
I'm free to have fun around the clock.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.000
Jeepers, I'm exhausted.

00:04:41.001 --> 00:04:44.001
The kitchen of tomorrow is calling me.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.000
My cake is ready.

00:04:55.001 --> 00:05:00.001
Time for the show, everybody on stage.

00:05:09.001 --> 00:05:14.000
And now, a glamorous dancer and a
special number, Dance of Tomorrow.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:22.000
Everyone

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:26.000
says the future is strange,
but I have a feeling some things won't change.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.000
Now, the dream car is of tomorrow.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:00.001
A magnificent El Dorado town car by Cadillac.

00:06:00.001 --> 00:06:03.001
Ensemble by Christian Dior of Paris.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:14.000
Buick presents the sleek Centurion.

00:06:14.001 --> 00:06:17.000
Driving coat by Montezano of New York.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.000
Oldsmobile's elegant golden rocket.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.001
Sports outfits by Pat Primo of Los Angeles.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.000
Pontiac's Club de Mer, open to the sky.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.001
Costume by Emilio Capri.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:57.000
Chevrolet's Impala, graceful and swift.

00:06:57.001 --> 00:07:00.000
Silk casual by Digby Morton of London.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:14.000
And last of all, designed for the electronic
highway of the future, the fabulous,

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.001
turbine-powered Firebird 2.

00:07:56.001 --> 00:07:58.001
Firebird 2, to control tower.

00:07:58.001 --> 00:08:01.000
We are about to take off on
the highway of tomorrow.

00:08:02.001 --> 00:08:03.000
Stand by.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.000
Tomorrow,

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:20.000
tomorrow, our dreams will come

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:23.000
true.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:31.000
Together, together,

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.001
we'll make the one new.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:44.001
Strings, shapes will rise out of the

00:08:44.001 --> 00:08:46.001
night.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:53.000
But all love will not change here.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:59.001
It will be like a star burning bright,
Losing our way,

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.001
We [...]
